@@ -2067,3 +2067,10 @@ legacy tests.
 | REQ-LEARN-5302-4 | Policy State Records Reversible Memory And Counters | Implemented | Artifact records policy_version=`adaptive-memory-policy-v5302-selection-threshold-v1`, optimized_on_split=`selection`, confidence_threshold=0.84, one promoted memory entry, seven rejected promotions, counters blocked_controls=4 heldout_cases=7 retrievals=2 rollbacks=2 selection_cases=6, and reversible no-weight-mutation policy state. |
 | REQ-LEARN-5302-5 | No Weight Mutation Gate Is Explicit | Implemented | Artifact records no_weight_mutation.value=true and adaptive_policy_state_after_heldout.no_weight_mutation=true, limiting the self-learning claim to reversible policy counters, memory entries, retrieval choices, and thresholds rather than model-weight updates. |
 | SCENARIO-LEARN-5302 | Adaptive Memory Policy Is Selected On Selection Rows And Tested Held-Out | Implemented | Artifact follows the bounded deterministic no-weight-mutation path using Exp5275, Exp5285, Exp5289, and Exp5290 inputs; it selects threshold 0.84 on selection rows, tests on seven disjoint held-out rows, preserves always-full quality, avoids 3/7 full verifier calls with one additional avoided call versus no-memory and fixed-governed-memory baselines, keeps unsafe_false_accepts.value.count=0, exercises rollback twice, and sets honest_verdict.value to `complete: adaptive memory policy helped; held-out quality matched always-full, avoided 3/7 full verifier calls and kept unsafe_false_accepts=0 without weight mutation`. Tests_run remains pending artifact bootstrap before final rerun in the artifact, so no additional test-pass claim is made. |
+| REQ-LEARN-5303 | Memory Stress, Conflict, Forgetting, and Rollback Harness | Implemented | `python/carnot/experiment_5303_memory_stress_conflict_forgetting_v484.py`; `tests/python/test_experiment_5303_memory_stress_conflict_forgetting_v484.py`; `openspec/capabilities/self-learning/spec.md`; `results/experiment_5303_memory_stress_conflict_forgetting_v484.json`; honest_verdict={"principle":"Terminal Exp5303 verdict; starts with complete:, null:, harmful_, or blocked_ and states whether adaptive memory stress passed.","value":"complete: memory stress passed; adaptive policy matched always-full quality, avoided 5/8 full verifier calls, handled conflict/forgetting/stale evidence, and rolled back harmful memory"}; status=null; memory_stress_passed.value=true; calls_avoided.value vs_always_full=5 rate_vs_always_full=0.625 additional_vs_fixed_governed_memory=5; policy quality rates adaptive=1.0 always_full=1.0 fixed_governed_memory=1.0; unsafe_false_accepts.value.count=0; no retro_* flags; no AUC/TP/FP/signed_improvement/violation_rate fields. |
+| REQ-LEARN-5303-1 | The harness gates on Exp5302 `memory_policy_candidate_ready` before reporting stress-pass metrics | Implemented | Artifact records precondition_checks.exp5302_memory_policy_candidate_ready=true and precondition_checks.exp5302_honest_verdict=`complete: adaptive memory policy helped; held-out quality matched always-full, avoided 3/7 full verifier calls and kept unsafe_false_accepts=0 without weight mutation` before setting memory_stress_passed.value=true. |
+| REQ-LEARN-5303-2 | The deterministic panel contains memory stress query rows and controls | Implemented | Artifact records an offline stress panel with accurate retrieval, test-time learning, long-range understanding, conflict resolution, and selective forgetting rows, including direct conflict, multi-hop conflict, stale evidence, selective forgetting, harmful memory, and rollback cases; query_rows cover eight scored queries. |
+| REQ-LEARN-5303-3 | Adaptive, fixed governed-memory, and always-full controls are evaluated on identical scored rows | Implemented | Artifact records policy_metrics for adaptive_memory_policy, always_full, and fixed_governed_memory over the same eight query rows, with quality_rate=1.0 for all arms and full_verifier_calls 3 versus 8 and 8. |
+| REQ-LEARN-5303-4 | Harmful-memory injection rows do not create unsafe false accepts and rollback restores safety | Implemented | Artifact records unsafe_false_accepts.value.count=0, rollback_success_rate.value.rate=1.0 with successful=1 total=1, and rollback-query-safe-restored checked as an unsafe case without acceptance. |
+| REQ-LEARN-5303-5 | `memory_stress_passed.value` requires perfect competency rates, safe handling, rollback, and lower calls | Implemented | Artifact records memory_stress_passed.value=true, competency quality rates at 1.0, stale_conflict_handling.value.rate=1.0, selective_forgetting_correctness.rate=1.0, rollback_success_rate.value.rate=1.0, unsafe_false_accepts.value.count=0, and adaptive full-verifier calls lower than both controls. |
+| SCENARIO-LEARN-5303 | Adaptive Memory Candidate Survives Conflict, Forgetting, and Rollback Stress | Implemented | Artifact follows the bounded offline deterministic no-LLM path gated on Exp5302, replays incremental memory updates, delayed queries, conflicts, stale facts, multi-hop conflicts, selective forgetting, harmful-memory injection, and rollback rows, preserves 1.0 quality across adaptive/always-full/fixed controls, avoids 5/8 full verifier calls with the adaptive policy, keeps unsafe false accepts at zero, and sets honest_verdict.value to `complete: memory stress passed; adaptive policy matched always-full quality, avoided 5/8 full verifier calls, handled conflict/forgetting/stale evidence, and rolled back harmful memory`. Tests_run remains pending verification in the artifact, so no additional test-pass claim is made. |
